# and impacted-intermediates.json on https://emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com/: the four roots, then
# one certificate per compromised intermediate key, then one Sectigo cross-sign - a second
# certificate for an intermediate key already listed. Fixture for the trust-store check's tests.

